    {
      "name": "reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xreU1tVlhTbXBEZGt4aVdtWXhlVGRKUlV0TmVsRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "месяц назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "My deepest praise and gratitude go to Dr. Mirha Hasanbegovic, specialist in internal medicine and cardiology, who treated my elderly mother as an emergency case during our vacation in Montenegro.\nDr. Hasanbegovic’s outstanding medical knowledge, professionalism, dedication, and genuine human touch were truly exceptional. Her ability to provide such excellent care was all the more impressive given the obvious limitations in advanced medical equipment at the medical center.\nShe is a true pearl, both professionally and personally, and a doctor whom any medical institution should be proud to have. I sincerely hope that the Pljevlja Medical Center recognizes, values, and takes good care of such an outstanding physician.\nWe are deeply grateful to her for the care, reassurance, and humanity she showed my mother at a very difficult moment.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "My deepest praise and gratitude go to Dr. Mirha Hasanbegovic, specialist in internal medicine and cardiology, who treated my elderly mother as an emergency case during our vacation in Montenegro.\nDr. Hasanbegovic’s outstanding medical knowledge, professionalism, dedication, and genuine human touch were truly exceptional. Her ability to provide such excellent care was all the more impressive given the obvious limitations in advanced medical equipment at the medical center.\nShe is a true pearl, both professionally and personally, and a doctor whom any medical institution should be proud to have. I sincerely hope that the Pljevlja Medical Center recognizes, values, and takes good care of such an outstanding physician.\nWe are deeply grateful to her for the care, reassurance, and humanity she showed my mother at a very difficult moment.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
